{"id":"NCT04220970","title":"Breast Implant-associated Anaplastic Large Cell Lymphoma (BIA-ALCL) Registry","official":"Breast Implant-associated Anaplastic Large Cell Lymphoma (BIA-ALCL) Registry","summary":"Anaplastic large cell lymphoma associated with breast implants (BIA-ALCL) is a rare disease seen only in women with a breast implant.\n\nBecause of the low incidence of this disease and the peculiar histological subtype, French authorities, in accordance with the recommendations of an expert group, recommended the implementation of a BIA-ALCL case registry, in connection with a national Multidisciplinary meeting (Réunion de Concertation Pluridisciplinaire nationale de recours- RCP).\n\nThis registry is opened in France and in Belgium","conditions":["Anaplastic Large Cell Lymphoma Associated With Breast Implants (BIA-ALCL)"],"interventions":[{"type":"OTHER","name":"BIA-ALCL"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Adult patients with an anaplastic large cell lymphoma associated with breast implants\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n\\-","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"FEMALE","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":150,"start":"2017-06-07","pcd":"2032-06-07","upd":"2026-01-14","sponsor":"The Lymphoma Academic Research Organisation","areas":["oncology","rare"],"central":["Manon Croix · +33 (04) 72 66 93 33 · manon.croix.ext@lysarc.org"],"sites":[{"f":"CH d Avignon - Hopital Henri Duffaut","city":"Avignon","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":43.9483,"lon":4.8089,"c":"Borhane SLAMA, MD · 04 32 75 93 00 · bslama@ch-avignon.fr"},{"f":"Institut Bergonié","city":"Bordeaux","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":44.8412,"lon":-0.5805,"c":"Fontanet BIJOU, MD · +33 05 56 33 78 32 · f.bijou@bordeaux.unicancer.fr"},{"f":"CHRU de Brest - Hôpital Morvan","city":"Brest","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":48.3903,"lon":-4.4863,"c":"Adrian TEMPESCUL, MD · 02 98 22 33 95 · adrian.tempescul@chu-brest.fr"},{"f":"Hopital Louis Pasteur","city":"Colmar","pr":"","zip":"","s":